	(text "R420: 0R 0603 in the Cmod VU feed (5V -> 5V_CMOD -> J40 pin 24). Populated by default (v1 power strategy:\ncarrier 5V powers the module). DNP to isolate the module from carrier 5V - the backfeed-safe procedure for\nrunning the Cmod from its own USB (bitstream load / D012 snapshot drain) while the carrier is live.\nSee orchestration/rails.md. (Review 2026-08-26 B1.)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 100 110 0)
		(effects
