	(text "PWR_FLAGs: +3.3V is sourced by the T-012 power tree (power_supply sheet); the flag is kept so this\nsheet is ERC-clean standalone. The stale +5V PWR_FLAG that masked the orphan VU net (review 2026-08-26 B1)\nis DELETED - the VU feed now runs J40.24 -> R420 (0R) -> the global 5V net driven by the power mux.\nETH_VDDCR is driven by the LAN8720A internal 1.2V regulator (whole block DNP)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76 140 0)
		(effects
